official_references.official_effect_text:
[b]Once[/b] [b]per turn[/b]: [b]You can[/b] Ritual Summon 1 WIND Ritual Monster from your Deck, by Tributing Spirit monsters [b]and[/b]/or "Shinobird Token(s)" from your field, whose total Levels equal or exceed the Ritual Monster's Level. Twice [b]per turn[/b], if a face-up WIND monster(s) you control is returned to your hand (except during the Damage Step): [b]You can[/b] activate 1 of these effects;
● Add 1 of your Spirit monsters or Ritual Spells that is banished or in your GY to your hand.
● Set 1 "Stars Align across the Milky Way" directly from your Deck.
